# KPI Starter structure

Keep modular boundaries so new work does not re-bloat `main.py` / inline DEMO.

## Where things go

| Change | Put it here | Do not |
|--------|-------------|--------|
| New industry pack | `packs/{slug}.py` + append to `PACK_MODULES` in `packs/registry.py` | Inline DEMO/BENCHMARKS in `main.py` / `dense_packs.py` |
| Pack spoken labels (en/ko) | `i18n/pack_l10n.py` entry for that slug | Hardcode only-JP in board templates |
| UI chrome strings | `i18n/strings.py` | Scatter literals across HTML builders |
| Shared KPI 説明 | `metrics/help.py` | Duplicate long help per pack |
| Sample nav category | `packs/catalog.py` + `cat.*` in `i18n/strings.py` | Ad-hoc category strings in rail HTML |
| Board layout / board CSS | `sample_dense.py` / `dense_packs.py` | Per-industry alternate board UIs |
| Rail nav markup | `_rail_nav_html` in `sample_dense.py` | Fork a second sample nav |

## Pack checklist (new slug)

1. `packs/{slug}.py` with `PACK` (`meta.category`, benchmarks, demo, copy, event_desc)
2. `PACK_MODULES` in `registry.py`
3. `PACK_L10N[slug]` with at least `label` / `hint` for `ja` / `en` / `ko`
4. Run `python scripts/smoke_packs.py`

## Rail CSS

`.rail .pack-cat*` styles are duplicated in `sample_dense.py` and `settings_page.py`. When changing rail look, update **both**, or extract a shared CSS helper — do not leave them drifting.

## Product frame (do not reopen lightly)

Same dense board for every pack; samples ≠ live; connect applies 業界目安 only. Details: `kpi-starter-ux` rule.
